   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Cut Throat Boogie (Live)**: back after 35 archived shows (515 days) [4]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Field of Vision (Live) [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2024-08-16.SBD** (recommended): soundboard; 25 songs; 180 min [1]\n- **kglw2024-08-16.mysteryjackofficial**: audience recording; 26 songs; 179 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Daily Blues was preceded by a brief Led Zeppelin Rock and Roll tease [1]\n- Boogieman Sam included ZZ Top La Grange and Work This Time teases [1]\n- This Thing was introduced as a song about Ambrose with New York City lyrics [1]\n- A jam exceeding three minutes was labeled before Doom City due to its length [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2024-08-16.SBD**: taped by Sam Joseph, Joe Santarpia, Grace Reader, Gaspard De Meulemeester; source: SBD [1]\n- **kglw2024-08-16.mysteryjackofficial**: taped by @mysteryjackofficial; transferred by @mysteryjackofficial; source: AUD- Church Audio CA14 Cardioid Microphones> Roland R-07 Digital Recorder @ 24bit/48kHz WAV- ORTF- Mounted thigh high on the concrete barricade. Row 1 in the… [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by Jason Galea Standard Edition: [King Gizzard & the Lizard Wizard setlist - 2024-08-16 Forest Hills Stadium, Queens, NY, USA](https://kglw.net/setlists/king-gizzard-the-lizard-wizard-august-16-2024-forest-hills-stadium-queens-ny-usa.html) [5]\n- Poster by panetory.com: [King Gizzard And The Lizard Wizard Forest Hills Stadium Forest Hills NY Aug 16 2024 Poster 2026](https://panetory.com/king-gizzard-and-the-lizard-wizard-forest-hills-stadium-forest-hills-ny-aug-16-2024-poster) [6]",
